# Module 05: Operational KPI Dashboard & AI Narrative Insights Generator

## Executive Summary
Raw operational data (support tickets, expense claims, purchase orders) requires transformation into actionable key performance indicators. While metric computation requires deterministic mathematical precision, translating multi-dimensional tables into executive summaries requires context-aware synthesis. This module combines exact algorithmic KPI aggregation, multi-panel visual charting, and AI-driven executive narrative generation.

---

## Business Problem & Value Proposition
* **Problem Statement:** Standard dashboard tools (PowerBI, Tableau) display metrics effectively but fail to synthesize findings into narrative executive briefings, requiring manual BA analysis every reporting cycle.
* **Business Impact:** Automates weekly/monthly operational status reporting, reduces executive brief preparation times from hours to seconds, and provides immediate visibility into process SLA compliance bottlenecks.

